    [" \"Oh right, there is a prerequisite that you must keep in mind and strictly follow!\" \n Old Neil placed the two candles, turned his body to look at Klein, and said very seriously: \n \"Low-sequence Beyonders are not yet powerful enough, and almost all Ritual Magic that can be performed is to beg for power and request help from the outside. Therefore, you can only consider orthodox gods like the Goddess and the Lord of Storms. Absolutely, absolutely do not try to communicate with unknown, unpredictable existences, even if someone worships them, and even if the recorded promises are full of temptation!\" \n \"Believe me, do not hold a lucky mindset. As long as you try it once, you will inevitably slide into the abyss. All efforts and all struggles can only delay the speed, not reverse the trend.\" \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Clown\", Chapter 53, Grounded Ritual Magic"] = "\"Oh right, there is a prerequisite that you must keep in mind and strictly follow!\" \n Old Neil placed the two candles, turned his body to look at Klein, and said very seriously: \n \"Low-Последовательность Потустороннийs are not yet powerful enough, and almost all Ritual Magic that can be performed is to beg for power and request help from the outside. Therefore, you can only consider orthodox gods like the Goddess and the Lord of Storms. Absolutely, absolutely do not try to communicate with unknown, unpredictable existences, even if someone worships them, and even if the recorded promises are full of temptation!\" \n \"Believe me, do not hold a lucky mindset. As long as you try it once, you will inevitably slide into the abyss. All efforts and all struggles can only delay the speed, not reverse the trend.\" \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Клоун\", Chapter 53, Grounded Ritual Magic",
    ["　　Meeting the \"Inquisitor\" was accidental. His real name is Black, and he is a middleman for the council's security team. He is quite capable of fighting; I have seen with my own eyes how he used a saw-blade to hack down ten people. \n　　But as a friend, he speaks gently and is generous with his money. The first time he treated me to a drink, he said he just wanted to make a friend. The second time he gave me a pocket watch, saying it was to thank me for helping him with a small favor. The third time he asked me if I was interested in earning some extra money. \n　　I said, I am a policeman. \n　　He said, policemen are also human. \n　　I returned the pocket watch to him and turned to leave. But that thought popped up again—money can buy greater power. I'm just borrowing it; it won't be too late to deal with them after I stand firm. \n　　A week later, I gave him a call."] = "Встреча с «Инквизитором» была случайной. Его настоящее имя — Блэк, и он посредник в службе безопасности совета. Он вполне способен сражаться; Я своими глазами видел, как он пилой зарубил десять человек. \n　　Но как друг, он говорит мягко и щедро тратит деньги. В первый раз, когда он угостил меня выпивкой, он сказал, что просто хочет завести друга. Во второй раз он подарил мне карманные часы, сказав, что хочет поблагодарить меня за небольшую услугу. В третий раз он спросил меня, хочу ли я подзаработать. \n　　Я сказал, я полицейский. \n　　Он сказал, что полицейские тоже люди. \n　　Я вернул ему карманные часы и повернулся, чтобы уйти. Но эта мысль возникла снова: за деньги можно купить большую власть. Я просто одолжил его; еще не поздно будет с ними разобраться, когда я буду тверд. \n　　Через неделю я позвонил ему.",
